(text "PVDF film (~1.4 nF class) with 10M bias: high-pass ~11 Hz. R42 limits clamp current during heel-strike spikes." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 160.02 128.0 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "5797bfb9-f4fe-4ebb-9ab0-72d141d8167c"))
(text "D2/D3 clamp the buffer input to the rails. Low-leakage diodes: leakage x 10M sets the offset budget (check datasheet)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 160.02 130.2 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "a925c8ad-cb66-45ea-a953-b7d46e0e8fe2"))
(text "R44/C41 = 339 Hz single pole for 2 kHz sampling: only ~10 dB at Nyquist. Treat as exploratory; oversample and" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 160.02 132.4 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "48080edb-97c7-48a6-9fcd-e47ef92190da"))
(text "decimate in firmware or add a 2nd-order stage after the E3 cable-motion experiment." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 160.02 134.6 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "b08fe920-4b8c-4b47-a718-0ba711bb96fc"))
